### get all
GEt {{baseUrl}}/api/healthCareFacilities
Authorization: {{Token}}

### get by id
GEt {{baseUrl}}/api/healthCareFacilities/b3f3a709-3762-4f5a-99a8-0d1ab4c27d5e
Authorization: {{Token}}

### get by User Id
GEt {{baseUrl}}/api/healthCareFacilities/me
Authorization: {{Token}}

### by Latitude and Longitude 
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/healthCareFacilities?GPSLatitude=33.5138&GPSLongitude=36.2765&radiusKm=2
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}


### Update a Health Care Facility
